Welcome to The 21st Century, and the game of Assassin.  This game was 
originally coded for CNet BBS.  I have modified it to run with
TransAmiga BBS v1.1+ for your enjoyment.  I spent three days re-coding
some of the routines, and changing all of CNet's MCI commands to
regular ANSI sequences.  There may still be some bugs in the game, and
as I find them, I'll update the game and the archive.  Hope you enjoy
this conversion.

Installation:
-------------

 o Unarchive Assassin.LHA and copy all files and directories into your
   BBS:Extras directory. 

 o Copy the Assassin.trans file to your BBS:Rexx

 o Edit your Extras.RX file to include a line for the game.

A Assassin                 5 -------- Assassin.trans

 o Add a line to your TPTCron's CronTab file (You are using it,
   right?) to run the CLog.Cron program at midnight (or whenever you
   do your maintenance period). This will clean up the logs that the
   game uses, so as not to fill your hard drive up. :-)

 o Adjust any custom menus (if you have them) so that your callers
   know the game is there.


